   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "So, you chose to cook up brews and potions as an Alchemist. I'm sure that'll come in handy in your travels.\r\n\r\nI reckon I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Mana Well for your camp. Build one of these and all of the healers and spellcaster types will come running to get a refreshing taste.",
   "time": 1791062902,
   "title": "Camping 101: Alchemy",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Elwynn Forest"
  },
  "97915-complete": {
   "build": "70205",
